{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "40e23946-4800-8bd4-85ec-6f75b34e2cb2",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T12:56:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Liam Hanlon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:55:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Happy Christmas Eve, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:55:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. I'm calling about recycling. What can go in the bin now? My brother, my older brother, he's the one who told me to call. He said the rules changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:55:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What are you wondering about specifically?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:55:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pizza boxes, glass, and those plastic clamshells, the ones the berries come in. Are those all okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:55:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, pizza boxes, glass, and clamshells. Generally clean, empty containers are fine, and a pizza box with a lot of grease on it isn't. Clamshells depend on the plastic type, so I'd check the number on the bottom. I can mail you the current list if you like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd be good. Is there a fee for any of that? Like for the bin, or the pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for standard curbside recycling. Where's the pickup, so I send it to the right place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's my mother's house, 390 Coggeshall Avenue. Up on the Hill, by where the old, um, the old corner market was. Well, that's gone now. Just 390 Coggeshall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 390 Coggeshall Avenue. I'll get the list out to her. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good holiday."
    }
  ],
